			"name": "Language",
			"reference": "B23",
			"local_notes": "Lore: The Cult Mechanicus' machine-cant: a clipped, heavily compressed binary/logical language spoken and sub-vocalized between adepts, servitors, and machine spirits alike, ranging from a few ritual phrases a menial picks up to the dense technical liturgy a Magos trades with another Magos.\n\nDesign: Basic Set Language (B23), a new specialization; not a new skill in its own right. Buy levels (Broken/Accented/Native) exactly as any other Language, per B23's own rules.",
